  <tr>
    <td valign="center" colspan="2">Mostly stock. Just a couple screw kits, handlebar risers, and bar-ends from <a href="http://www.murphskits.com">Murph's</a>.</td>
    <td><a href="images/2011-03-01_12-07-20_420.jpg"><img align="right" border="0" src="images/2011-03-01_12-07-20_420_1.jpg" width="400" /></a></td>
  </tr>

